@model Portal.Components.BannerModel
@* The console explains itself in place. Several of its facts — netid attribution, what report
   mode actually permits, where policy authority comes from — are exactly the things an operator
   would otherwise get wrong, so they belong next to the data rather than in a manual.

   Text only, encoded by Razor. A banner that accepted markup would be a rendering hole in the
   one component whose whole job is to carry trusted explanatory copy. *@
<div class="banner">
    <span class="bico" aria-hidden="true">@Model.Icon</span>
    <div>@Model.Text</div>
</div>
